WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.902
EXPLAIN shows how PostgreSQL plans to execute the
statement The

00:00:05.929 --> 00:00:11.508
purpose here is not to memorize every plan node It
is to build the habit

00:00:11.534 --> 00:00:17.487
of checking instead of guessing On real workloads
data volume indexes

00:00:17.711 --> 00:00:21.013
statistics and PostgreSQL version all affect the
plan
